OL,3,GNEWSAFamily's fear for hydropower
OL,4,Aworker among thousands missing after
OL,5,Aflood
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman in mid Wales has spoken of her
OL,8,Ffear as she awaits news of a family
OL,9,Fmember in Nepal, who is missing
OL,10,Ffollowing the massive flash flood last
OL,11,Fweek.
OL,13,FJyoti Upadhyay, who is from Nepal but
OL,14,Fhas lived in Tal-y-bont in Ceredigion
OL,15,Ffor the past five years, said she and
OL,16,Fher husband had not been able to find
OL,17,Fout anything about the whereabouts of
OL,18,Fhydropower station worker Jit Bahadur
OL,19,FChaudhary.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
