OL,3,GNEWSAFamily's fear for hydropower
OL,4,Aworker among thousands missing after
OL,5,Aflood
OL,6,
OL,7,FChaudhary, who is not a blood relation
OL,8,Fbut is considered family by Upadhyay as
OL,9,Fhe has lived with her mother-in-law for
OL,10,Fthe past 25 years, was working at the
OL,11,FTrishuli 3B site.
OL,13,F"To be honest, since Saturday we have
OL,14,Flost hope," said Upadhyay.
